## 3. Unified Architecture Review Severity (`BLOCKER` / `MAJOR` / `MINOR`)

| Severity | Architectural Criteria | Review Verdict Impact |
|---|---|---|
| `BLOCKER` | Failed boundary validator/linter gate (`FAIL`), upward/forbidden layer import, leaked storage/DTO model across boundaries, unclosed stateful resource, or violation of A1–A8, A10 | `CHANGES_REQUESTED` (blocks approval) |
| `MAJOR` | Misplaced responsibility across layers, implicit lazy-load hazard (A9), or unsplit God module modified in task scope | Must be fixed in the same revision when inside task scope |
| `MINOR` | Minor file/folder naming polish within the correct layer | Optional (never blocks approval) |

